/Title (The TrueValue Framework reframes commodity supply chain investment from a question of asset exposure to a question of structural quality and natural resource flows. Two supply chains producing identical volumes of the same commodity are not equivalent investments if their structural balance profiles differ. The one with higher phase balance scores has lower hidden risk, greater adaptive capacity, and superior long-run value capture.)
/Dest [31 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1463 0 R
/Next 1870 0 R
>>
